# Trial-Size Trial by Water (outlands 148), the guard's other operands. A WAR of level 20 at Norg fame level 2: not
# offered (114 on both talks); accepted by GM, the WAR's trade of the fork: nothing (the SMN test of the trade), and the
# talk is 111 (the accepted arm reads no job). The level side is #level19.
char zone=Norg pos=-12.5,1.1,-22.5 job=WAR lvl=20
fame Norg 50
item MiniTuningForkOfWater
login
trigger Verctissa                         # UseFallback 0: the default 114
finish
trigger Verctissa                         # the script: not a SMN: the quest's nil; the default 114
finish
quest Outlands.TrialSizeTrialByWater accepted
trade Verctissa MiniTuningForkOfWater x1  # not a SMN: nothing
trigger Verctissa                         # the default 114
finish
trigger Verctissa                         # the fork held: 111
finish
